{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle, upgrade, and outsmart your enemies in fast-paced, Pac-Man-style stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let auto-play grind coins for you (it\u2019s not as good as you are\u2014trust me), or take control and go for risky, high-reward runs. Team up with allies, dodge quirky enemies, and collect keys to unlock the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Play: Earn coins while you\u2019re away, but don\u2019t expect flawless gameplay\u2014keep it on the safe stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Deploy Allies: Buy allies, place them strategically, and pass by to trigger their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pac-Man-Inspired Action: Weave through speeding, shooting, and even flying enemies while hunting keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure-Friendly: Lose only your earnings and allies\u2014jump back in as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New &amp; Improved from the Browser Version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smoother controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more welcoming tutorial to get you started</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reincarnator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949890/a04ce70a9b3d9c02174e6861f61e0fede015f0b1.jpg"},{"name":"The Real Battle Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949890/06ac6195903252a93194e23e910f02bb5269927e.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond Vengeance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949890/32f19aacee9379904e890943de7c1915b561c656.jpg"},{"name":"Thank You for Playing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949890/4563f263b449d65c8ea607a9bf59eed2c108d6bc.jpg"},{"name":"King of Idlers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3949890/60663cd87d4f1438385bf798db93bd3781f0d3f7.jpg"}],"total":